                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Hi, Beverley. This is Jason Groves from KC Events Management. I'm calling with some disappointing news. We have sold far fewer tickets for your upcoming concert than we had hoped. You are scheduled to perform two weeks from now, but we predict the conce\"}],[\"text\",{\"value\":\"rt hall will only be half full. It might be a good idea to move the performance from the concert hall to a smaller venue. So, I’d like you to consider some other locations in the downtown area. Don’t forget about Rosewood Theater. I’ve already checked, and\"}],[\"text\",{\"value\":\" it’s available on the concert date.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
            },
